Package: voipexa
Title: Value of Information (voi) as a ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs the functions of the voi package (Jackson et al.,
    <https://chjackson.github.io/voi/>) on UBC ModelsCloud, so that methods
    needing INLA or JAGS can be used without installing them locally. It is
    called by the voiremote client, which sends the arguments as exactly
    encoded data and receives voi's result as the complete R object. Only
    data is accepted; functions of voi that take R functions are not
    offered.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: curl, jsonlite, utils, voi
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), INLA, splancs, rjags
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/raminrzn/voipexa
